# The Temple of Uggalepih: a helper, area 2. Main (current, status 0) and eve (the mission completed,
# Headstone Pilgrimage current, no key) both get the menu (bit 1) and enter area 2 (option 2). The three
# Gravitons of area 2 (+5 to +7) die: 32001 to both (eve's with a seventh param, 1). Eve's finish changes
# nothing; main's is The Temple of Uggalepih's (mission.zilart.the_temple_of_uggalepih): status 1. Each
# kill also counts EVERYONES_GRUDGE_KILLS for both (Everyone's Grudge, another script).
lists SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrade SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32001 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32002 SacrificialChamber/onZoneIn/1 SacrificialChamber/_4j2/onTrigger
char zone=SacrificialChamber pos=299,0.1,349 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=SacrificialChamber pos=299,0.1,349 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih current
keyitem SacrificialChamberKey
eve: mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
eve: mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
eve: mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
eve: mission Soa Abomination current
eve: mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih completed
eve: mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
login
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _4j0
update 32000 option=2                   # index 0, area 2: entered
finish
eve: trigger _4j0
eve: update 32000 option=2
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill GRAVITON+5
kill GRAVITON+6
kill GRAVITON+7                         # all three dead: won, 32001 to both
eve: finish                             # eve (not current): nothing
finish                                  # main: the mission's 32001, status 1
